      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALWAYSBGOOD (9) resumes from a spell of 11 weeks after a successful maiden campaign where he placed in all six starts, winning three. Overcame a similar draw to this when digging deep to score at this circuit and distance two starts back. May have developed further with maturity and should be ready to go of a couple of trial placings. Hard to knock the recent consistency of ROCKIN BULL (7). Has come from wider barriers than this to place in his two outings at this venue since a Newcastle win. Can continue the strong form. CASH AND BLING (4) should find this easier than Saturday's attempt and did well for a 1.1m second from a wider barrier here last week. MAJOR BYE (8) has been racing well and can play a role with even luck from a wide draw.",
